OL,3,ABadenoch to speak to BBC as Tories
OL,4,Apledge #10bn 'British Iron Dome' air
OL,5,Adefence system
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch will
OL,8,Fspeak to BBC Breakfast at 07:30 BST and
OL,9,FRadio 4's Today programme at 08:10 BST
OL,10,F- follow along here or watch live at
OL,11,Fthe top of this page
OL,13,FThe Tories are holding their party
OL,14,Fconference in Birmingham this week,
OL,15,Fwith Badenoch set to give her keynote
OL,16,Fspeech on Wednesday
OL,18,FIt comes as Conservatives have pledged
OL,19,Fto invest #10bn in a "British Iron
OL,20,FDome" air defence system if they win
OL,21,Fthe next general election
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
